{"seq":3,"slug":"dimensional-weight-freight-link","title":"计费重 DIM 与运费成本联动（联067）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/packaging-loading-optimization/cartonization-algorithm/dimensional-weight-freight-link","wordCount":1913,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"计费重-dim-与运费成本联动-联067\">计费重 DIM 与运费成本联动（联067）</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>承运人不会按你箱子里装了什么收钱，而是按一个由体积换算出来的重量收钱。这个量叫<strong>体积重</strong>（dimensional weight，也叫 volumetric weight、DIM weight、cubed weight），定义是&quot;由包裹的长宽高计算出的一个估算重量&quot;，其计算式是 (长 × 宽 × 高) ÷ 除数，最终计费取<strong>实际重量与体积重中较大者</strong>（见 <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dimensional_weight\">Dimensional weight</a>）。</p>\n<p>这个规则的存在带来一个直接后果：<strong>对轻泡货来说，箱子的大小就是价格</strong>。你把箱型换大一档，箱材成本可能只多几毛，但体积重可能翻倍，运费直接跳一档。选箱算法如果只看几何可行性不看计费重，就会系统性地选到又大又贵的箱。这也是本 hub 把计费重放在算法章而非结算章的原因——它是目标函数的组成部分，不是事后核算。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[箱外廓 L×W×H] --&gt; B[体积 cm³]&#10;  B --&gt; C[除以渠道除数 D]&#10;  C --&gt; D[体积重 W_dim]&#10;  E[实际毛重 W_act] --&gt; F{取较大}&#10;  D --&gt; F&#10;  F --&gt; G[计费重 W_charge]&#10;  G --&gt; H[计费率 × 分区]&#10;  H --&gt; I[运费]&#10;  I --&gt; J[选箱目标函数]\">graph TD\n  A[箱外廓 L×W×H] --&gt; B[体积 cm³]\n  B --&gt; C[除以渠道除数 D]\n  C --&gt; D[体积重 W_dim]\n  E[实际毛重 W_act] --&gt; F{取较大}\n  D --&gt; F\n  F --&gt; G[计费重 W_charge]\n  G --&gt; H[计费率 × 分区]\n  H --&gt; I[运费]\n  I --&gt; J[选箱目标函数]</pre><h2 id=\"除数体系\">除数体系</h2><h3 id=\"主要承运人的除数值\">主要承运人的除数值</h3><p>除数是体积与重量的换算比例，取值的本质是&quot;承运人认为一公斤货应当占据多少立方厘米&quot;。各家的除数不同，且同一家在不同服务、不同重量段、不同区域上也不一致。可核验的一组公开数值如下（见 <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dimensional_weight\">Dimensional weight</a>）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>承运人 / 服务</th>\n<th>英制除数 (in³/lb)</th>\n<th>公制除数 (cm³/kg)</th>\n<th>备注</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>FedEx 国际及美国境内</td>\n<td>139</td>\n<td>5,000</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>UPS 国际</td>\n<td>139</td>\n<td>5,000</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>UPS 美国日结价，超过 1 立方英尺</td>\n<td>139</td>\n<td>5,000</td>\n<td>阈值为 1,728 in³</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>UPS 美国零售价 / 日结价 1 立方英尺及以下</td>\n<td>166</td>\n<td>6,000</td>\n<td>小包裹用更宽松的除数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>UPS 加拿大境内 UPS Standard</td>\n<td>166</td>\n<td>6,000</td>\n<td>与加拿大普通件不同</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DHL 全球</td>\n<td>138</td>\n<td>5,000</td>\n<td>报道中英制四舍五入为 138</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DHL 阿联酋</td>\n<td>111</td>\n<td>4,000</td>\n<td>区域特例</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>USPS 国际 Global Express Guaranteed</td>\n<td>166</td>\n<td>6,000</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>USPS 美国 Priority Mail，5–9 区、超 1 立方英尺</td>\n<td>194</td>\n<td>7,000</td>\n<td>最宽松的除数</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这张表的工程含义是：<strong>除数必须是渠道配置数据，不能硬编码</strong>。同一个箱在 FedEx 国际按 5,000 算可能计费 8kg，在 USPS Priority Mail 按 7,000 算只有 5.7kg，运价排序会完全不同。把除数写进代码常量，等于把渠道策略锁死在发布周期里。</p>\n<h3 id=\"航空货运的-6000-惯例\">航空货运的 6000 惯例</h3><p>航空货运长期使用 6,000 cm³/kg（约合 166 in³/lb）作为体积换算标准，被视为 IATA 相关的通用惯例，但该来源并未给出具体的 IATA 决议编号——所以引用时应当表述为&quot;航空货运常用 6,000&quot;，而不是声称它来自某条具体决议（见 <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dimensional_weight\">Dimensional weight</a> 对 166 in³/lb 常见于 IATA 货运的说明）。海运与零担则多用立方（CBM）直接计价，不换算成重量，这一点在整柜装载里要单独处理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"计算细节\">计算细节</h2><h3 id=\"取整与进位\">取整与进位</h3><p>体积重的取整规则因渠道而异。公制下体积重通常以整公斤档表示并<strong>向上取整</strong>（见 <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dimensional_weight\">Dimensional weight</a> 的说明），这意味着一票 5.01kg 的体积重会按 6kg 计费。选箱算法在比较方案时如果不做同样的取整，会得到与账单不符的排序——这就是&quot;算法算出来 A 方案更省，账单却是 B 方案更省&quot;的典型原因。</p>\n<h3 id=\"尺寸的取整同样重要\">尺寸的取整同样重要</h3><p>尺寸测量的取整也影响结果：多数承运人按整厘米或整英寸计量并向上取整。所以算法内部用毫米甚至更细的单位计算是对的，但在<strong>成本评估环节</strong>必须重放承运人的取整口径。这一条与 <a href=\"../dimension-packaging-masterdata/item-dimension-weight-masterdata\">尺寸主数据</a> 里&quot;容差按用途分别规定&quot;的设计是同一个原则：计算精度与业务口径分离。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def billable_weight(carton, channel):&#10;    # 复刻承运人口径：先按渠道单位向上取整尺寸，再算体积重&#10;    l = ceil_to(carton.outer_l_mm, channel.dim_round_mm)&#10;    w = ceil_to(carton.outer_w_mm, channel.dim_round_mm)&#10;    h = ceil_to(carton.outer_h_mm, channel.dim_round_mm)&#10;    vol_cm3 = (l * w * h) / 1000.0&#10;    w_dim_g = vol_cm3 / channel.divisor_cm3_per_kg * 1000.0&#10;    w_dim_g = ceil_to(w_dim_g, channel.weight_round_g)      # 通常上取整到下一档&#10;    return max(carton.gross_weight_g, w_dim_g)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> billable_weight</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(carton, channel):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 复刻承运人口径：先按渠道单位向上取整尺寸，再算体积重</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    l </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ceil_to(carton.outer_l_mm, channel.dim_round_mm)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    w </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ceil_to(carton.outer_w_mm, channel.dim_round_mm)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    h </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ceil_to(carton.outer_h_mm, channel.dim_round_mm)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    vol_cm3 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (l </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> w </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> h) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1000.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    w_dim_g </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> vol_cm3 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> channel.divisor_cm3_per_kg </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1000.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    w_dim_g </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ceil_to(w_dim_g, channel.weight_round_g)      </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 通常上取整到下一档</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(carton.gross_weight_g, w_dim_g)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>注意这里用的是<strong>外廓尺寸</strong>而不是内径：承运人量的是箱子外面，纸板厚度算进价格里。这一点常被忽略，导致双瓦箱的计费重被低估。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与选箱和装载的联动\">与选箱和装载的联动</h2><h3 id=\"目标函数里的空间价格\">目标函数里的空间价格</h3><p>把计费重代入选箱成本，可以得到一个很有用的中间量——<strong>空间价格</strong>，即每立方厘米的体积在该渠道值多少钱：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mrow><mi>v</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow><mi>D</mi></mfrac><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mtext>每 cm</mtext><mn>3</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda_{vol} = \\frac{rate}{D} \\quad (\\text{每 cm}^3)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.9781em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2921em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">每</span><span class=\"mord\"> cm</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8873em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">rate</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span></span></span> 是该渠道每公斤费率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 是除数。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mrow><mi>v</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda_{vol}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 越大，越应当压缩箱体体积；越小，则越可以为了操作便利选稍大的箱。分销渠道多了之后，这个量会自然地把商品按&quot;泡重比&quot;分成几类：泡货（体积重 &gt; 实重）要拼命压体积，重货（实重 &gt; 体积重）则几乎不关心箱体积。</p>\n<h3 id=\"泡重比与分档\">泡重比与分档</h3><p>定义泡重比 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r = W_{dim}/W_{act}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">im</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r &gt; 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 的订单，其成本由体积主导；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r &lt; 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 的由重量主导。这个比值可以直接作为选箱策略的路由键：对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 明显大于 1 的订单，提高体积项的权重，甚至允许用更薄的包材换取小的外廓；对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 接近或小于 1 的订单，把权重移到保护性上（因为此时破损成本占比更高，见 <a href=\"../cost-damage-balance/material-damage-dimweight-tradeoff\">包材成本/破损率/体积重权衡</a>）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"与装载层的耦合\">与装载层的耦合</h3><p>计费重的影响会一路传导到托盘与集装箱层。托盘高度每增加一层，集装箱能装的托盘数就可能减少，而运输成本按柜或按立方计。所以在 <a href=\"../pallet-container-loading/container-uld-3d-loading-weight\">集装箱三维装箱</a> 里，&quot;把托盘码到刚好不超过柜高&quot;是一个直接的省钱动作——多出的那一层如果进不了柜，就只是白占了仓库。</p>\n<h2 id=\"结算侧的校验\">结算侧的校验</h2><h3 id=\"与承运人账单比对\">与承运人账单比对</h3><p>算法预测的计费重必须与承运人账单逐票比对。差异的常见来源有三：尺寸测量口径不同（外廓 vs 内径、取整方向）、重量测量设备未检定（见 <a href=\"../dimension-packaging-masterdata/item-dimension-weight-masterdata\">尺寸主数据</a> 关于衡器法定检定的讨论）、以及承运人在中转环节重新量方。建立&quot;预测 vs 账单&quot;的偏差分布，是把计费重从估算变成可管理量的唯一途径。</p>\n<h3 id=\"争议与举证\">争议与举证</h3><p>当账单显著高于预测时，能否申诉取决于你手里有没有可核验的证据链。这要求系统能回答：这票货当时用的是哪一版尺寸、哪台设备量的、方案里箱型内径与外径各是多少。这正是主数据要保留 <code>provenance</code> 与 <code>effectiveFrom</code> 的现实价值——不是为了学术上的可追溯，而是为了在争议时有据可依。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>计费重取实际重量与体积重的较大者，体积重 = 体积 ÷ 除数；除数是渠道配置而非代码常量。</li>\n<li>主要承运人除数集中在 139/166/194（英制）与 5,000/6,000/7,000（公制），同家不同服务也不同。</li>\n<li>航空货运的 6,000 cm³/kg 是通用惯例，但不要声称它出自某条具体 IATA 决议。</li>\n<li>取整方向（尺寸上取整、重量上取整到档）必须被算法复刻，否则方案排序与账单不符。</li>\n<li>体积重按外廓尺寸算，纸板厚度计费；空间价格 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mrow><mi>v</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda_{vol} = rate/D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 决定了压体积的紧迫程度。</li>\n<li>泡重比 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 可作为选箱策略的路由键；预测值必须与承运人账单逐票比对并保留举证链。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸\">延伸</h2><p>体积重是选箱目标函数的一项，完整目标函数见 <a href=\"optimal-carton-selection-algorithm\">单件/多件最优箱选择算法</a>；体积重如何与破损成本互相拉扯，见 <a href=\"../cost-damage-balance/material-damage-dimweight-tradeoff\">包材成本/破损率/体积重权衡</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"计费重 DIM 与运费成本联动（联067）","id":"计费重-dim-与运费成本联动-联067"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"除数体系","id":"除数体系"},{"level":3,"text":"主要承运人的除数值","id":"主要承运人的除数值"},{"level":3,"text":"航空货运的 6000 惯例","id":"航空货运的-6000-惯例"},{"level":2,"text":"计算细节","id":"计算细节"},{"level":3,"text":"取整与进位","id":"取整与进位"},{"level":3,"text":"尺寸的取整同样重要","id":"尺寸的取整同样重要"},{"level":2,"text":"与选箱和装载的联动","id":"与选箱和装载的联动"},{"level":3,"text":"目标函数里的空间价格","id":"目标函数里的空间价格"},{"level":3,"text":"泡重比与分档","id":"泡重比与分档"},{"level":3,"text":"与装载层的耦合","id":"与装载层的耦合"},{"level":2,"text":"结算侧的校验","id":"结算侧的校验"},{"level":3,"text":"与承运人账单比对","id":"与承运人账单比对"},{"level":3,"text":"争议与举证","id":"争议与举证"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸","id":"延伸"}],"prev":{"title":"堆码/朝向/嵌套与体积利用率","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/packaging-loading-optimization/cartonization-algorithm/stacking-orientation-nesting-fillrate"},"next":{"title":"托盘堆码/缠绕/规格与单元化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/packaging-loading-optimization/pallet-container-loading/pallet-pattern-unitization-wrapping"}}